@startuml
' Detailed variable and method connection map for QA Wolf
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Config {
  - projectRoot: string
  - buildDir: string
  - headless: boolean
  - testHeadless: boolean
  - hackerNewsNewestUrl: string
  + getLocalDateStamp(date): string
  + getRunId(date): string
  + getRunPaths(date): RunPaths
}

class Logging {
  - lines: string[]
  + log(message)
  + warn(message)
  + error(message)
  + table(data)
  + getLines(): string[]
  + clearLines()
}

class SetupModule {
  + ensureBuildDir()
  + section(title)
  + runCommand(command, args, options)
  + getNpmCliPath()
  + runNpm(args, options)
  + execNpm(args, options)
  + getPackageVersion(packageName)
  + getPlaywrightFromLocation(location)
  + detectRuntime()
  + checkNode()
  + checkNpm()
  + checkPlaywrightNpmVersion()
  + checkPlaywrightBrowsers(playwright)
  + printModal(message, options)
  + ask(question)
  + recoverMissingPlaywright()
  + writeLogs()
  + main()
}

class Data {
  - temp: string
  - dates: string[]
  - titleLine: string[]
  - links: string[]
  + DirCreation(buildDir, ScreenCapsDir)
  + formatRelativeTime(inputString)
  + parseRelativeDateData(ageString)
  + dataCollector(type, page, initial)
  + generateTextTable(array)
}

class Camera {
  - ScreenCapsDir: string
  - photoSnaps: number
  + snap(page)
}

class TableModel {
  - tableData: any[]
  - rows: number
  - cols: number
  + push(table, dat)
}

class Terminal {
  - data: Data
  + cOut(txt)
  + dSpace()
  + tabGen(data)
  + script(choice, vars)
}

class HtmlReportGenerator {
  - outputPath: string
  + constructor(outputPath)
  + parseCleanDate(dateStr)
  + escapeHtml(value)
  + writeReport(dataArray, linksArray)
}

Config "1" --> "*" Data : provides paths/dateStamp
Config --> Camera : passes screenshotsDir
Config --> HtmlReportGenerator : provides report path
Logging <.. Terminal : uses
Logging <.. SetupModule : uses
Logging <.. HtmlReportGenerator : uses
SetupModule --> Logging : writes setup output
Data --> Logging : logs warnings and table output
Camera --> Logging : warns on closed pages
HtmlReportGenerator --> Data : consumes table rows and links
Terminal --> Data : optionally uses data for report generation
@enduml
